<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Happy Birthday Sayang 💖</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;600&family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6e7,#fff0f5);
overflow:hidden;
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

.container{
width:90%;
max-width:400px;
position:relative;
z-index:10;
}

.page{
display:none;
animation:fade 1s ease;
}

.active{
display:block;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}

.envelope{
font-size:120px;
cursor:pointer;
animation:bounce 1.5s infinite;
}

@keyframes bounce{
0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(-10px);}
}

.photo{
width:100%;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
margin:20px 0;
}

.btn{
background:#ff5c8d;
border:none;
padding:14px 28px;
border-radius:30px;
color:white;
font-size:16px;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:20px;
box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(255,92,141,.4);
}

.letter-half{
font-size:120px;
cursor:pointer;
}

.letter{
background:white;
padding:25px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
max-height:70vh;
overflow:auto;
text-align:left;
}

.letter h2{
font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;
font-size:38px;
text-align:center;
color:#ff4d88;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.letter p{
font-size:15px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
}

.music{
margin-top:20px;
display:inline-block;
background:#ff85a2;
padding:12px 20px;
border-radius:30px;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
color:#ff4d88;
animation:fall linear infinite;
top:-50px;
}

@keyframes fall{
to{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="page active" id="page1">
<h2>Pencet suratnya ya sayang 💌</h2>
<div class="envelope" onclick="nextPage(2)">💌</div>
</div>

<div class="page" id="page2">
<img src="foto-kita.jpg" class="photo">
<h2>Hai sayang happy birthday again ya 🎂💖</h2>
<p>Etss... klik lanjut dulu 😚</p>
<button class="btn" onclick="nextPage(3)">Lanjut</button>
</div>

<div class="page" id="page3">
<h2>Pencet suratnya dulu 😚</h2>
<div class="letter-half" onclick="nextPage(4)">📖</div>
<p>Biar bisa baca semuanya 💌</p>
</div>

<div class="page" id="page4">
<div class="letter">
<h2>For U 💖</h2>

<p>
Haii sayang 💖<br><br>

This is ur day and i want to say something... jangan merasa ini adalah hari biasa ya, this is ur special day, dimana kamu di adakan oleh tuhan buat ketemu orang2 yg kamu sayang like ur familly dan pastinya i always with u 🤍<br><br>

Makasi juga sama tuhan km ada di disini dan aku bisa jadi bagian kecil dalam hidupmu, semoga kamu merasa cukup ya, u are a special boy for me 💖<br><br>

I hope ur life freely, joyfully, and peacefully. No one in the world deserves a bad life, including u.<br><br>

Kalau suatu saat nanti kita gabisa bareng dengan usaha maupun tidak, inget semua hal baik, lucu, dan bahagia kita ya sebelum km bener bener mau ngelupain semuanya 🥹<br><br>

Love u always 🤍<br>
I'm so sorry if i bad for u.
</p>

<a class="music"
href="https://youtu.be/1jO2wSpAoxA?si=H6K5b6"
target="_blank">
🎵 Play Music
</a>

</div>
</div>

</div>

<script>
function nextPage(page){
document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(p=>{
p.classList.remove('active');
});
document.getElementById('page'+page).classList.add('active');

if(page===4){
confetti({
particleCount:200,
spread:120
});
}
}

function createHeart(){
const heart=document.createElement('div');
heart.classList.add('heart');
heart.innerHTML='💖';
heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';
heart.style.fontSize=(Math.random()*20+15)+'px';
heart.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*3+3)+'s';
document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},6000)
}

setInterval(createHeart,300);
</script>

</body>
</html>
